                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/releases/tag/11.3.10"&gt;11.3.10&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Enhancements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Allow stopping composition animation by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/zxbmmmmmmmmm/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/zxbmmmmmmmmm"&gt;@zxbmmmmmmmmm&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3630673237" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20074" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20074/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20074"&gt;#20074&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Introduce &lt;code&gt;PathSegmentEllipsis&lt;/code&gt; TextTrimming by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Gillibald/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Gillibald"&gt;@Gillibald&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3632724510" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20077" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20077/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20077"&gt;#20077&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Enable antialiasing based on &lt;code&gt;EdgeMode&lt;/code&gt; in &lt;code&gt;DrawBitmap&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/snowflysky/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/snowflysky"&gt;@snowflysky&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3650740498" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20116" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20116/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20116"&gt;#20116&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Reduce allocations in text rendering by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/Washi1337/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/Washi1337"&gt;@Washi1337&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3675389812" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20175" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20175/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20175"&gt;#20175&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Improve effect render performance by providing Skia with information about subscene bounds by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/kekekeks/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/kekekeks"&gt;@kekekeks&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3682274184" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20191" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20191/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20191"&gt;#20191&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Controls – Add &lt;code&gt;StrokeMiterLimit&lt;/code&gt; property to &lt;code&gt;Shape&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/jsuarezruiz/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/jsuarezruiz"&gt;@jsuarezruiz&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3670503905" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20156" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20156/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20156"&gt;#20156&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
