&lt;li&gt;Windows – Export bitmap in more clipboard formats by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/emmauss/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/emmauss"&gt;@emmauss&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3689834045" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20209" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20209/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20209"&gt;#20209&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;macOS – Implement accessibility value setter by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/MrJul/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/MrJul"&gt;@MrJul&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3719018369" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/20262" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20262/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/20262"&gt;#20262&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;X11 – Add basic Pen support by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/flabbet/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/flabbet"&gt;@flabbet&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3549440682" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/19910" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19910/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/19910"&gt;#19910&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
